# Patterns to silently ignore from the LinkChecker ignored links summary.
# These are not actual links or are internal generated files that don't
# need manual checking. One regex per line.

# data:image/svg+xml; is used for the arrows left to collapsible sections.
# All data links are ignored for future evolutions.
^(- )?data:.*$

# See comments in .linkcheckerrc
^(- )?.*/sitemap\.xml$
